                },
                {
                  "id": "bd4c9ad",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "title": "New Tree convertim un desert en un jardí",
                    "header_size": "h2",
                    "align": "left",
                    "title_color": "#1E2A22",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 30,
                      "sizes": []
                    },
                    "typography_font_weight": "700"
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "heading"
                },
                {
                  "id": "398e3d2",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Us oferim un servei de disseny i creació de jardins a mida, per adaptar-nos a les vostres necessitats i poder-vos oferir un servei totalment personalitzat.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 16,
                      "sizes": []
                    }
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "text-editor"
                },
                {
                  "id": "b948f9c",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Cada racó té les seves pròpies característiques: l'objectiu és dissenyar el jardí intentant ressaltar els seus punts forts.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 16,
                      "sizes": []
                    }
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "text-editor"
                },
                {
                  "id": "200928a",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Això vol dir tenir en compte tres conceptes importants: proporció, unitat i línies geomètriques.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 16,
                      "sizes": []
                    }
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "text-editor"
                },
                {
                  "id": "9890f1d",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>La proporció es refereix sobretot a la mida del que volem plantar, ha de ser proporcionat.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 16,
                      "sizes": []
                    }
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "text-editor"
                },
                {
                  "id": "2b5ab28",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Els elements naturals també contribueixen a aquesta funció: els arbres que es desenvolupen horitzontalment donen una sensació de tranquil·litat; els verticals, en canvi, donen una sensació d'ordre i dinamisme.</p>",
                    "text_color": "#6B7280",
                    "align": "left",
                    "typography_typography": "custom",
                    "typography_font_size": {
                      "unit": "px",
                      "size": 16,
                      "sizes": []
                    }
                  },
                  "elements": [],
                  "widgetType": "text-editor"
                }
              ],
